Z||000000||grinthock||07-18-2001||06:57 PM||||Hi everyone;<P>This is just a note to say I got AMAZING service from Rodney Dickman... I got his dual strut kit today and installed it, all I can say is WOW!! What great engineering, installed in 10 minutes with NO problems, he offers his phone # for problems, but hell I didn't need it.<P>The Gas Struts are amazing quality, the brackets sent are easy to install and high quality.<P>He even emailed me to ask what options I had on the trunk so he could send struts powered to the right PSI so my struts would work right.....<P>Great job Rodney.... ||||reg||1
Z||000001||terryk||07-18-2001||07:07 PM||||He's one of the few bright spots in the Fiero aftermarket arena.||||reg||14
